 "arms": {
  "full": {
   "text": "\"Welcome to the ultimate arcade of laughter and action! *Funny Fighting* is a hilarious fighting game where every move is a punchline and every victory is a laugh. Whether you're battling a goofy boss or outsmarting your opponent with clever strategies, the fun never stops. *Smart Stunts* – perfect for fans of clever gameplay that keeps you on your toes. Each character has a unique style, and every battle is a chance to showcase your wit and agility. *Unleash the Jester* – because the best battles are the ones that leave you grinning from ear to ear. With a mix of humor, skill, and creativity, *Funny Fighting* is the perfect blend of arcade action and comedic relief. Whether you're a seasoned fighter or a new player, this game is designed to keep you entertained and laughing. *Funny Fighting* is not just a game; it's an experience that combines the best of arcade gameplay with the joy of a well-timed joke. So, grab your controller, get ready to fight, and let the humor take over! *Funny Fighting* – where every move is a punchline, and every victory is a laugh. \"",
